      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "自然数的平方？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1052",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "а) 五个连续自然数的和能不能是质数？",
        "б) 五个连续自然数的平方和能不能是质数？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1053",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "证明：对于任意的 $n\\in N$，式子 $3^{n+2}-2^{n+2}+3^n-2^n$ 的值",
        "能被 $10$ 整除。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1054",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "证明：$p^2-1$ 能被 $24$ 整除，其中 $p$ 是大于 $3$ 的质数。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1055",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "证明：对于大于 $1$ 的任意自然数 $n$，下列各式的值不可",
        "能是质数：",
        "а) $n^4+4$；　　б) $n^4+n^2+1$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1056",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$10^{10}$ 共有多少个约数？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1057",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\frac{10^{10}+1}{10^{11}+1}$ 和 $\\frac{10^{11}+1}{10^{12}+1}$，哪个分数值较大？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1058",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "证明：对于任意自然数 $n$，可以找到这样的自然数 $x$，",
        "使得式子 $nx+1$ 的值是一个自然数的平方。"
      ]
    },
